    "round": 2,
    "role": "maker",
    "content": "The implementation plan is ready for review:\n\n- [Implementation plan](/work/specs/001-bookmark-manager/plan.md)\n- [Technical research](/work/specs/001-bookmark-manager/research.md)\n- [Data model](/work/specs/001-bookmark-manager/data-model.md)\n- [UI behavior contract](/work/specs/001-bookmark-manager/contracts/ui-contract.md)\n- [Validation guide](/work/specs/001-bookmark-manager/quickstart.md)\n\nThe plan uses a client-only React/TypeScript app with transactional IndexedDB storage, accessible keyboard-friendly interactions, and layered automated testing. No backend or account system is introduced.\n\nThe plan passes its design gates. Please approve it or request changes; after approval, I’ll generate the dependency-ordered task breakdown.",
